        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Design consists of two repeated scenes separated by a plant, each represents an equestrian figure raising one hand and a man holding a spear towards an animal in the lower half of the band; a bird (eagle ?) is above each of the equestrian figures; the design closely resembles those in the silks with the name  \"Zacharias\" found in Egypt."@en ;
